            }
          ],
          "prefix": "U",
          "ratings": {
            "i_max": 0.2,
            "rows": [
              {
                "name": "電源電圧",
                "value": "4.5〜16V"
              },
              {
                "name": "出力電流",
                "value": "200mA (最大)"
              }
            ],
            "v_max": 16.0
          },
          "sim": {
            "element": "",
            "kind": "subckt",
            "limits": [
              "コンパレータ2つとラッチ、出力段を部品で組んだ簡易モデルです。しきい値 (電源の 2/3 と 1/3) と出力 (High は電源 −1.7V) を再現します。",
              "温度や個体によるしきい値のずれ、電源に流れる出力切替時のスパイク電流は扱いません。実物の NE555 は 4.5V 未満では動作が保証されません。",
              "周期は部品が理想のときの値です。実物は、コンデンサの誤差や漏れ電流で 5〜20% ずれることがあります。"
            ],
            "name": "NE555",
            "params": {},
            "pins": [
              "2",
              "6",
              "5",
              "4",
              "3",
              "7",
              "8",
              "1"
            ],
            "text": "* NE555 behavioural model: resistor divider, two comparators, an SR latch and an output stage,\n* all built from voltage-controlled switches (S) so that it works at any supply voltage.\n.subckt NE555 trig thres ctl rst out disch vcc gnd\n* three 5k resistors: ctl = 2/3 Vcc, low = 1/3 Vcc\nRd1 vcc ctl 5k\nRd2 ctl low 5k\nRd3 low gnd 5k\n* half supply: the logic threshold\nRh1 vcc hv 100k\nRh2 hv gnd 100k\n* threshold comparator (high when THRES > CONT) and trigger comparator (high when TRIG < 1/3 Vcc)\nRcp rcmp gnd 10k\nScr vcc rcmp thres ctl SWC\nRsp scmp gnd 10k\nScs vcc scmp low trig SWC\n* NOR latch: Q = NOR(reset, Qb), Qb = NOR(set, Q); RESET (active low) forces Q low\nRq vcc q 10k\nSq1 q gnd rcmp hv SWL\nSq2 q gnd qb hv SWL\nSq3 q gnd hv rst SWL\nRqb vcc qb 10k\nSb1 qb gnd scmp hv SWL\nSb2 qb gnd q hv SWL\n* output: high = Vcc - 1.7 V (bipolar totem pole), low sinks through a few ohms\nVdrop vcc oh DC 1.7\nSoh oh out q hv SWH\nSol out gnd hv q SWS\n* discharge transistor: on while Q is low\nSd disch gnd hv q SWD\n* quiescent supply current\nRiq vcc gnd 2k\n.model SWC SW(RON=100 ROFF=1G VT=0 VW=0.005)\n.model SWL SW(RON=100 ROFF=1G VT=0 VW=0.1)\n.model SWH SW(RON=15 ROFF=1G VT=0 VW=0.1)\n.model SWS SW(RON=12 ROFF=1G VT=0 VW=0.1)\n.model SWD SW(RON=10 ROFF=1G VT=0 VW=0.1)\n.ends NE555"
          }
        },
